  "description": "High-performance pure C# .NET 10 LLM inference engine. Native AOT compatible, zero-copy memory-mapped GGUF models, SIMD AVX-512 and AVX2 quantized GEMV kernels (Q4_K, Q6_K, Q8_0, Q4_0, FP16), unmanaged KV-cache ring buffers, and embedded BPE tokenizers. Pure C# alternative to Ollama and vLLM.",
